<p id="_3aa332af-f083-c041-e000-1446480d14af" semx-id="_3aa332af-f083-c041-e000-1446480d14af">(M) = mandatory   (M*) = mandatory and repeatable<br/> © = conditional   (C*) = conditional and repeatable<br/> (O) = optional   (O*) = optional and repeatable</p>

