<clause id="sec-rights-restrictions-and-responsibilities-blocks" anchor="sec-rights-restrictions-and-responsibilities-blocks" obligation="normative" semx-id="_98a38819-10b5-8d3a-f747-2d67442cdd7f">
<title id="_8dd41d0d-3f68-a0d0-67bd-dd407c89e370" semx-id="_4bdb5e05-7266-0374-5cae-3d06ca98f7f1">Rights Restrictions and Responsibilities Blocks</title><fmt-title depth="3" id="_0e1a9f85-2e11-ff10-368c-63e6cbc5b59f"><span class="fmt-caption-label">2<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>5<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>4</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_8dd41d0d-3f68-a0d0-67bd-dd407c89e370">Rights Restrictions and Responsibilities Blocks</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 2<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>5<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>4</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_b704515d-cec0-57c8-ea4a-68caae2e0f47" semx-id="_b704515d-cec0-57c8-ea4a-68caae2e0f47">The Right, Restriction and Responsibility objects carry the descriptions of the right, restriction and responsibility attributes. These are shared attributes through referencing.</p>

<clause id="sec-rights-block" anchor="sec-rights-block" obligation="normative" semx-id="_9ca89843-b849-8e8e-d280-b2b19d02b2b1">
