<p id="_dfb5a9ea-cf22-dbf4-d316-e61385cbee03" semx-id="_dfb5a9ea-cf22-dbf4-d316-e61385cbee03">An S121_Responsibility is a formal or informal obligation to do something. The ResponsibilityBlock describes a responsibility.</p>

