<clause id="sec-location-block" anchor="sec-location-block" obligation="normative" semx-id="_74e0dbad-1b69-021f-648c-069aa9c79ec3">
<title id="_74a0da64-b790-5d6f-6ada-5b098b275910" semx-id="_02e15cd6-cd7c-4f78-6732-02e60a0a3b0f">Location Block</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_82660e07-7306-22df-f72c-7207c458745f"><span class="fmt-caption-label">2<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>5<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>6<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_74a0da64-b790-5d6f-6ada-5b098b275910">Location Block</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 2<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>5<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>6<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>1</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_9dd84b1a-c6e9-4e46-ea8a-d51e6a77763b" semx-id="_9dd84b1a-c6e9-4e46-ea8a-d51e6a77763b">The Location block is an object that defines the underlying structure of location. Note that the Oid block ID is used. Name and Label are not alternatives for referencing.</p>

<table id="tbl-locationblock-optional" anchor="tbl-locationblock-optional" semx-id="_62e09b19-6f20-7593-3562-c7a0c4ab176e" autonum="2-12">
<name id="_8daf7239-2e1a-2d60-400e-553660862b88" semx-id="_c89aa585-e751-9d11-1dd2-4074be63b753">LocationBlock — optional</name><fmt-name id="_bef0136f-8067-2de6-13da-dd5f38dfdbab"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> 2<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">-</span>12</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"> — </span><semx element="name" source="_8daf7239-2e1a-2d60-400e-553660862b88">LocationBlock — optional</semx></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> 2<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">-</span>12</fmt-xref-label>
<tbody><tr id="_59154caf-5103-960e-1512-7971d7abcd47" semx-id="_59154caf-5103-960e-1512-7971d7abcd47"><th id="_eef8ab84-1763-9034-ca23-64362437d54b" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_eef8ab84-1763-9034-ca23-64362437d54b">*Attribute Name*h</th>
