</td>
</tr><tr id="_1e490237-4e4d-52f6-4d31-c8a5e95f5814" semx-id="_1e490237-4e4d-52f6-4d31-c8a5e95f5814"><td id="_b0810d11-8764-de57-d82f-02dbfa815ca4" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_b0810d11-8764-de57-d82f-02dbfa815ca4"><p id="_cb7b48d4-076d-7ef4-aee6-1f77fcaa073a" semx-id="_cb7b48d4-076d-7ef4-aee6-1f77fcaa073a">fuID</p>
</td>
<td id="_bc96c1c4-0c6e-2a66-2195-d0808cbbcc60" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_bc96c1c4-0c6e-2a66-2195-d0808cbbcc60"><p id="_43da26c2-60f4-067e-d317-f14cf49afd7c" semx-id="_43da26c2-60f4-067e-d317-f14cf49afd7c">Identifier of the Location object feature unit in the “Oid” (Object ID) format. The “Oid” comprises a unique character string and a namespace identifier which is also a unique character string. An example might be “Location-1” where “Location” is the namespace and “1” is the unique id within that namespace</p>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_552dd3db-e2c1-798c-cbfc-a194848de22d" semx-id="_552dd3db-e2c1-798c-cbfc-a194848de22d"><td id="_9a52ffac-9aac-7d83-0a7f-5add371e5d78" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_9a52ffac-9aac-7d83-0a7f-5add371e5d78"><p id="_eec5a482-03d5-f13d-0b55-5c9667be4d0f" semx-id="_eec5a482-03d5-f13d-0b55-5c9667be4d0f">label</p>
