<clause id="sec-curve-block" anchor="sec-curve-block" obligation="normative" semx-id="_bd8d2a40-2002-1131-b162-9e1e6cfd7c1a">
<title id="_a7b32b74-f0e6-476b-80c7-dc901db4bebb" semx-id="_f249c3e5-828f-1880-427d-05ed6a9c4ee1">Curve Block</title><fmt-title depth="4" id="_236ded91-4c34-0517-6c31-88bb17a0ec1f"><span class="fmt-caption-label">2<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>5<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>6<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>5</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_a7b32b74-f0e6-476b-80c7-dc901db4bebb">Curve Block</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 2<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>5<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>6<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>5</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_c2013e6c-f57a-329d-3979-ad7c22b33d3d" semx-id="_c2013e6c-f57a-329d-3979-ad7c22b33d3d">The Curve block is an object that defines the spatial geometry of a Curve.</p>

<table id="tbl-curveblock-optional" anchor="tbl-curveblock-optional" semx-id="_64a2375c-b8b7-a3f4-8048-c2beb2bd6d06" autonum="2-16">
