<ul id="_cccf392b-df26-241c-fa2d-e0fc9ea0cf39" semx-id="_cccf392b-df26-241c-fa2d-e0fc9ea0cf39"><li id="_4520c1ae-c87b-7df7-74fd-51482fc1ed74"><fmt-name id="_20c9de30-4adf-4dca-c850-0396f2e125d7">•</fmt-name><p id="_5a85f0d8-0477-25b5-79d6-7f153e8b8214" semx-id="_5a85f0d8-0477-25b5-79d6-7f153e8b8214">Sequence of vertices (longitude coordinate, latitude coordinate or Direct Position), or</p>
</li>
<li id="_1137b6c0-082d-8bb7-2589-5d676ac5c9f3"><fmt-name id="_57723abd-b04c-3faa-6ff0-c8bed88c46da">•</fmt-name><p id="_7afc8bea-773a-c0a1-0551-5953522c6212" semx-id="_7afc8bea-773a-c0a1-0551-5953522c6212">arcByCentre (arcStart longitude, slash delimiter, arcStart latitude, comma delimiter, arcEnd longitude, slash delimiter, arcEmd latitude, comma delimiter, arcCentre longitude, slash delimiter, arcCentre latitude),  or</p>
</li>
