</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr><tr id="_41cea134-56be-23fa-69aa-148636ecbbe9" semx-id="_41cea134-56be-23fa-69aa-148636ecbbe9"><td id="_4544e3d4-30ad-c11e-1920-8fc584229f16" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_4544e3d4-30ad-c11e-1920-8fc584229f16"><p id="_8f0d6760-e6fd-a7be-bf6b-5419bbde7c29" semx-id="_8f0d6760-e6fd-a7be-bf6b-5419bbde7c29">wGS84CurveGeometrya</p>
</td>
