<ul id="_b0127d1b-6b8f-9db7-7c23-65e570446499" semx-id="_b0127d1b-6b8f-9db7-7c23-65e570446499"><li id="_fe70d4f5-d6f8-ec69-9deb-b75ed81cbe2b"><fmt-name id="_2b2b0d90-447e-923a-3ea1-1e117276e5af">•</fmt-name><p id="_fde0961f-f77f-d263-952e-939920432d1a" semx-id="_fde0961f-f77f-d263-952e-939920432d1a">Sequence of vertices (longitude coordinate, latitude coordinate or Direct Position), or</p>
</li>
