</li>
<li id="_cb58bbb9-6abf-6cde-36ec-851e43b78a6f"><fmt-name id="_8bcba4c5-c19a-5843-4150-443acb91c607">•</fmt-name><p id="_7366b6b4-38be-859d-dc95-a558f00877cf" semx-id="_7366b6b4-38be-859d-dc95-a558f00877cf">circleByCentre (circleCentre longitude, slash delimiter, circleCentre latitude, comma delimiter, circlePoint longitude, slash delimiter, circlePoint latitude)</p>
</li>
