<clause id="sec-profile-governance-block" anchor="sec-profile-governance-block" obligation="normative" semx-id="_86d3f51d-2561-3205-0181-537ce6d86f3d">
<title id="_9bea0c9c-5ec1-738b-ce5e-42304c7ee467" semx-id="_a14fe11c-e508-cb58-d235-6cb91108f918">Profile Governance Block</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_99fc7cda-52bf-144c-74f9-68beebf2bd91"><span class="fmt-caption-label">B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_9bea0c9c-5ec1-738b-ce5e-42304c7ee467">Profile Governance Block</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Annex</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_18c47c0d-cadf-3958-f6d5-dfd7cad7b754" semx-id="_18c47c0d-cadf-3958-f6d5-dfd7cad7b754">The profile of the Governance Block for deposit is a subset of the available elements. The names are selected to be meaningful for deposit.</p>

<p id="_9b7db70c-ddb4-65b1-68c8-6de4bd09bd5c" semx-id="_9b7db70c-ddb4-65b1-68c8-6de4bd09bd5c">The Description Attribute is expected to be many lines of text that will make use of the Record Extension capability to allow multiple paragraphs. This will correspond to the preamble of the deposit.</p>

<p id="_ab8dd8ac-ec1a-43fb-d6bc-0b3686369837" semx-id="_ab8dd8ac-ec1a-43fb-d6bc-0b3686369837">There is only one Governance Block per data file so there is no Block ID field in the Governance Block Descriptor Record. Reference to the Governance block from the Basic Administrative Unit Block is assumed.</p>

<p id="_330ae527-c76c-0865-a470-166a33c44545" semx-id="_330ae527-c76c-0865-a470-166a33c44545"><strong>Profile Governance Block First Record:</strong></p>

<table id="tbl-26" anchor="tbl-26" semx-id="_730e89ec-2f47-5af7-2a3c-417471afeefe" autonum="B-3"><fmt-name id="_e45097a0-94f4-1f84-9771-e703f96aed18"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">-</span>3</span></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">-</span>3</fmt-xref-label><tbody><tr id="_7e377042-a37d-ce2c-29fc-e189e1fda3e1" semx-id="_7e377042-a37d-ce2c-29fc-e189e1fda3e1"><th id="_560f502a-ed30-d1a3-1934-7172e52af3ad" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_560f502a-ed30-d1a3-1934-7172e52af3ad"><strong>Governance Block Descriptor Record Contents</strong></th>
</tr><tr id="_7f323006-85e3-4f8e-15db-a79174a1e544" semx-id="_7f323006-85e3-4f8e-15db-a79174a1e544"><td id="_578d018e-fee4-1865-32e6-d08538c70655" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_578d018e-fee4-1865-32e6-d08538c70655"><p id="_b9ca0116-00c3-1c6b-f3ac-d3b6c5b54af4" semx-id="_b9ca0116-00c3-1c6b-f3ac-d3b6c5b54af4">Maritime Limits and Boundaries deposit</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>

