<clause id="sec-responsibility-block" anchor="sec-responsibility-block" obligation="normative" semx-id="_8c7d53ea-8c0e-7d28-13b4-b43a95f6bb8f">
<title id="_ab3074c5-33d4-0058-b70f-48fa7242084c" semx-id="_34e5a949-2e32-0117-5687-c301a42e41c9">Responsibility Block</title><fmt-title depth="3" id="_458b4aa2-ff3b-b383-bb5b-109dbec5b1b5"><span class="fmt-caption-label">B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>6<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_ab3074c5-33d4-0058-b70f-48fa7242084c">Responsibility Block</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Annex</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>6<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>3</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_ae3f6d0f-8f11-604a-7e3d-c4ce10d03cf6" semx-id="_ae3f6d0f-8f11-604a-7e3d-c4ce10d03cf6">An S121_Responsibility is a formal or informal obligation to do something. The ResponsibilityBlock describes a responsibility.</p>

<p id="_6eff5582-4450-ee10-9dad-1a449354d6ef" semx-id="_6eff5582-4450-ee10-9dad-1a449354d6ef">For a deposit the only a subset of the description of a Restriction description is required.</p>

<p id="_7436be17-c2cd-8578-4ca4-5ebc2bc7102e" semx-id="_7436be17-c2cd-8578-4ca4-5ebc2bc7102e"><strong>Profile Responsibility Block Group Description:</strong></p>

<table id="tbl-39" anchor="tbl-39" semx-id="_a8e72228-7b90-24e1-ad76-c9bf1af7508a" autonum="B-16"><fmt-name id="_eacc49a4-2cdb-ce22-cde5-e9f2c16dc368"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">-</span>16</span></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">-</span>16</fmt-xref-label><tbody><tr id="_fab3939d-deaa-b54e-f39e-c3238a81c5ed" semx-id="_fab3939d-deaa-b54e-f39e-c3238a81c5ed"><th id="_1e4ec077-2788-89e3-d401-8384c5096021" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_1e4ec077-2788-89e3-d401-8384c5096021"><strong>Responsibilities Block Descriptor Record Contents</strong></th>
</tr><tr id="_e45d6d13-594e-56c4-983b-eb6908f2d5b9" semx-id="_e45d6d13-594e-56c4-983b-eb6908f2d5b9"><td id="_021cc10a-d9db-8c4d-a8d2-5cdc86829f83" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_021cc10a-d9db-8c4d-a8d2-5cdc86829f83"><p id="_e0cdc51b-7173-b011-1081-1237659b45c9" semx-id="_e0cdc51b-7173-b011-1081-1237659b45c9">Which relate to the following responsibilities</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>

<p id="_92906c01-28ae-09ba-7bb3-bad1d5ae32df" semx-id="_92906c01-28ae-09ba-7bb3-bad1d5ae32df"><strong>Profile Responsibility Block First Record (multiple Responsibility Blocks may exist):</strong></p>

<table id="tbl-40" anchor="tbl-40" semx-id="_1e9f831f-333e-9264-a829-c27f1c8d8b5a" autonum="B-17"><fmt-name id="_9bef36b6-774b-3bc5-ca61-00f6eaccd572"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">-</span>17</span></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">-</span>17</fmt-xref-label><tbody><tr id="_701ee850-dadc-142f-b346-a8844871d6d9" semx-id="_701ee850-dadc-142f-b346-a8844871d6d9"><th id="_54885128-5051-5883-0ac0-aa4d0cfae94b" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_54885128-5051-5883-0ac0-aa4d0cfae94b">*Responsibilities Block Descriptor Record Contents*h</th>
