</td>
<td id="_7fdabf11-e5ee-7b7e-e2cb-3aafb2457b73" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_7fdabf11-e5ee-7b7e-e2cb-3aafb2457b73"><p id="_b3ced06d-27f0-318d-c3bf-a596a01867e2" semx-id="_b3ced06d-27f0-318d-c3bf-a596a01867e2">Identifier of the Responsibilities block in the Oid format for example “Responsibility-1” or a unique “name”. In the case of “Responsibility” the unique name may derive from the responsibilityType attribute (for example Maintenance Responsibility). In that case the responsibilityType attribute is not needed</p>
</td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>

