<p id="_41a150dd-09dd-1961-2958-be80c9e6064a" semx-id="_41a150dd-09dd-1961-2958-be80c9e6064a">All of the information elements in the S121 model may have sources.  In a deposit the source is the depositing nation so many of the source attributes are not required.</p>

