</td>
<td id="_ab6f9cc5-56e9-624d-7586-ef6d0303130f" valign="top" align="left" semx-id="_ab6f9cc5-56e9-624d-7586-ef6d0303130f"><p id="_acf86202-e274-3af0-cb09-ec7cd527b8d6" semx-id="_acf86202-e274-3af0-cb09-ec7cd527b8d6">This attribute allows a spatial attribute to be a textual description. This allows “Location”, “Limit”, “Zone”s and “Space” that are not fully described geometrically to be included</p>

<p id="_3103e767-1980-b0ee-0b5e-3b33904259a5" semx-id="_3103e767-1980-b0ee-0b5e-3b33904259a5">Quantity Specifications</p>
