<p id="_2aee2d97-9607-27bd-499e-7902bb116f83" semx-id="_2aee2d97-9607-27bd-499e-7902bb116f83"> — A number of coordinate formats are permitted; however, it is recommended that only one coordinate format be</p>

<p id="_50caa63b-fc0e-9706-8337-d83a4cbee018" semx-id="_50caa63b-fc0e-9706-8337-d83a4cbee018"> — used for one type of coordinate in a dataset. Indicators of East / West and North / South may be either</p>

<p id="_dc85bf7d-57eb-c1b8-e7fa-a270db6ec06b" semx-id="_dc85bf7d-57eb-c1b8-e7fa-a270db6ec06b"> — E / W and N / S or + / -. When + and – are used the + is optional.</p>

