</bibitem><bibitem id="iso-19152-2012" type="standard" schema-version="v1.5.6" anchor="iso-19152-2012" semx-id="_d8c02a11-0b73-07e5-c233-84a55959dbe4"><biblio-tag>[13]<tab/></biblio-tag><formattedref>ISO 19152:2012: Geographic information — Land Administration Domain Model (LADM), International Organization for Standardization, committee, International Organization for Standardization (<fmt-link target="https://www.iso.org/standard/51206.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/51206.html</fmt-link>).</formattedref>
